OL,3,GNEWSAFlying club pays tribute after
OL,4,A'very popular' member and wife die in
OL,5,Aplane crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FA flying club said it was "very
OL,8,Fsaddened" after a "very popular" member
OL,9,Fand his wife died in a plane crash.
OL,11,FKetan Swali and Sheetal Swali from
OL,12,FSyston, Leicestershire, were pronounced
OL,13,Fdead at the scene after a light
OL,14,Faircraft they were in was found at a
OL,15,Fremote location close to Trawsfynydd,
OL,16,FGwynedd.
OL,18,FAir and ground searches were carried
OL,19,Fout to find the plane after police were
OL,20,Ftold just after 12:00 BST on August 14
OL,21,Fthat an aircraft had not arrived at
OL,22,FCaernarfon Airport as scheduled.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
