OL,3,GNEWSAFlying club pays tribute after
OL,4,A'very popular' member and wife die in
OL,5,Aplane crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Sherwood Flying Club, based in
OL,8,FStaffordshire, said the couple's death
OL,9,Fwas "affecting many people in the club
OL,10,Fwho knew them".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
